[I] Light-weight cryptographic and SSL/TLS library

[T] Mbed TLS is a C library implementing cryptographic primitives including
[T] the PSA Cryptography API, X.509 certificate handling and the SSL/TLS and
[T] DTLS protocols. Its small code footprint makes it suitable for embedded
[T] systems.

[U] https://www.trustedfirmware.org/projects/mbed-tls/

[A] Mbedtls Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/base
[F] CROSS OBJDIR

[V] 3.6.8
[L] APL
[P] X -----5---9 128.700

[CV-FLAGS] NO-MAJOR
[D] 71741585ea721a116bae71d38f626dd00d33fa14019b92b0b621f6b2 mbedtls-3.6.8.tar.bz2 https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/releases/download/mbedtls-3.6.8/

var_append cmakeopt ' ' '-DENABLE_TESTING=OFF -DENABLE_PROGRAMS=OFF'
